{"id":"dragon-tempests","name":"Dragon tempests","type":"concept","aliases":["draconic storms","elemental storms","storms","tempests","The Dragon Tempests","The dragon tempests","the storms"],"description":"The dragon tempests are violent magical storms on Tarkir, formed from Ugin's magic, that birth all of its dragons.","pages":8,"first_seen":"2015-01-07","last_seen":"2015-03-11","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Planeswalker's Guide to Fate Reforged","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2015-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Planeswalker's Guide to Fate Reforged\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Jan 2015."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwritten","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-01-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwritten\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Jan 2015."}],"bio":{"summary":{"text":"The dragon tempests are violent magical storms on Tarkir, formed from Ugin's magic, that birth all of its dragons.","cites":["p:stories/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","p:stories/unwritten-2015-01-14"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Planeswalker's Guide to Fate Reforged","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2015-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/p