 the Coast, 7 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07-e1","era":null,"summary":"Over millennia, Ugin's magic coalesced into dragon tempests that birthed five broods, each led by a dominant dragon revered by a clan.","participants":["ugin","dragon-tempests","dromoka","ojutai","silumgar","kolaghan","atarka"],"location":"tarkir","importance":"major","page":"stories/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","order":478,"story_date":"2015-01-07","storyline":"Fate Reforged","source":"wizards","paragraph":25,"quote":"Over the millennia, the spirit dragon Ugin's magic coalesced into powerful storms on his native plane of Tarkir.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07#:~:text=Over%20the%20millennia%2C%20the,native%20plane%20of%20Tarkir.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Planeswalker's Guide to Fate Reforged","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2015-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07#:~:text=Over%20the%20millennia%2C%20the,native%20plane%20of%20Tarkir.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Planeswalker's Guide to Fate Reforged\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"unwritten-2015-01-14-e5","era":null,"summary":"Sarkhan tells Yasova that in his homeland there are no dragons or dragon tempests, only bones, and that Ugin is long dead.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","yasova-dragonclaw","ugin","dragon-tempests"],"location":"temur-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/unwritten-2015-01-14","order":479,"story_date":"2015-01-14","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":104,"quote":"Not in all of Tarkir,\" he said. \"Only bones.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14#:~:text=Not%20in%20all%20of,he%20said.%20%22Only%20bones.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwritten","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-01-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14#:~:text=Not%20in%20all%20of,he%20said.%20%22Only%20bones.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwritten\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"unwritten-2015-01-14-e6","era":null,"summary":"Yasova confirms that she believes the dragons fall if Ugin dies, and Sarkhan realizes a storm guided him to her.","participants":["yasova-dragonclaw","sarkhan-vol","ugin","dragon-tempests"],"location":"temur-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/unwritten-2015-01-14","order":479,"story_date":"2015-01-14","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":107,"quote":"If Ugin dies, the storms cease. The dragons fall.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14#:~:text=If%20Ugin%20dies%2C%20the,cease.%20The%20dragons%20fall.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwritten","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-01-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwritten-2015-01-14#:~:text=If%20Ugin%20dies%2C%20the,cease.%20The%20dragons%20fall.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwritten\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-reforged-chain-2015-01-21-e0","era":null,"summary":"Sarkhan, flying in dragon form toward the tempests, despairs that Bolas's influence has already reached this ancient time.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","nicol-bolas","dragon-tempests"],"location":"tarkir","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-reforged-chain-2015-01-21","order":481,"story_date":"2015-01-21","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":3,"quote":"the influence of Bolas had somehow made it here before him","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150124070850/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/reforged-chain-2015-01-21#:~:text=the%20influence%20of%20Bolas,it%20here%20before%20him","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Reforged Chain","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2015-01-21","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/reforged-chain-2015-01-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150124070850/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/reforged-chain-2015-01-21#:~:text=the%20influence%20of%20Bolas,it%20here%20before%20him","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150124070850/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/reforged-chain-2015-01-21","license":null,"text":"\"The Reforged Chain\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Jan 2015. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-reforged-chain-2015-01-21-e6","era":null,"summary":"Ugin roars and calls Tarkir's dragons to his side; they stream out of the tempests.","participants":["ugin-the-spirit-dragon","sarkhan-vol","dragon-tempests"],"location":"tarkir","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-reforged-chain-2015-01-21","order":481,"story_date":"2015-01-21","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":25,"quote":"Dragons appeared in droves, flying out of the dragon tempests toward the fight.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150124070850/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/reforged-chain-2015-01-21#:~:text=Dragons%20appeared%20in%20droves%2C,tempests%20toward%20the%20fight.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publ